  "caveats": [
    "The test window (2008 onward) was already seen in Findings 15 and 17: nothing here is selected on it, but this is a model-selection study, not an untouched confirmation.",
    "Two equity indices and one test window dominated by two crises; coverage tests are asymptotic and a few exceedances move a rate by several tenths of a percent.",
